==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hater]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

